abstract: >
  A provenance-first knowledge-graph archive organized by the H-S-N coordinate
  system — a 12×12×12 hypercube addressing 1,728 cells across Houses, Spheres,
  and Nodes. Intended as a Periodic Table 2.0 candidate ontology for organizing
  knowledge, matter, resonance, artifacts, and review state.
